+++ b/releasenotes/notes/attempt-manager-async-context-manager-41eb2d3104fecc25.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+---
+features:
+  - |
+    The object yielded by ``async for attempt in AsyncRetrying(...)`` now supports
+    the async context manager protocol, so ``async with attempt:`` works inside the
+    loop and behaves exactly like ``with attempt:``.
